<dashboard version="1.1" theme="dark">
  <label>Hi Tim, what shall we build here?</label>
  <description>A blank canvas — pick what we build next in the dCloud Splunk lab.</description>

  <row>
    <panel>
      <html>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:48px 20px 28px;">
          <div style="font-size:40px;font-weight:700;color:#65a637;line-height:1.15;">
            Hi Tim 👋 what shall we build here?
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:16px;color:#cdd9e5;margin-top:14px;max-width:720px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.6;">
            This is a fresh canvas in the dCloud Splunk lab. Tell us the use case and we'll
            wire it up config-as-code — dashboards, alerts, data onboarding, correlation,
            whatever the demo needs.
          </div>
        </div>
      </html>
    </panel>
  </row>

  <row>
    <panel>
      <html>
        <h3 style="color:#65a637;">Ideas on the table</h3>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:8px;">
          <div style="flex:1 1 240px;background:#11151a;border:1px solid #2a3138;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;">
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#e6edf3;">📊 A new correlation view</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8b98a5;margin-top:6px;">Tie together another
            service, layer, or signal across London / Berlin / loc1.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1 1 240px;background:#11151a;border:1px solid #2a3138;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;">
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#e6edf3;">🔔 An alert + action</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8b98a5;margin-top:6px;">Webex, email, or a custom
            action — trigger on any condition you want to show.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1 1 240px;background:#11151a;border:1px solid #2a3138;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;">
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#e6edf3;">🧩 New data onboarding</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8b98a5;margin-top:6px;">SNMP, syslog, REST, a new
            container/app — a fresh source into its own index.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1 1 240px;background:#11151a;border:1px solid #2a3138;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;">
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#e6edf3;">🛠 Something else entirely</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8b98a5;margin-top:6px;">Say the word — we'll scope
            it and build it into the repo so it survives every reset.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="color:#8b98a5;font-size:12px;margin-top:16px;">Everything here is
        config-as-code in <code>js-csco/splunk-dcloud</code> and rebuilds automatically on
        every lab startup.</p>
      </html>
    </panel>
  </row>

  <row>
    <panel>
      <title>The lab is alive — events across all locations (last 60 min)</title>
      <chart>
        <search>
          <query>index=* earliest=-60m
| timechart span=5m count by index limit=8 useother=t</query>
          <earliest>-60m</earliest><latest>now</latest>
        </search>
        <option name="charting.chart">column</option>
        <option name="charting.chart.stackMode">stacked</option>
        <option name="charting.legend.placement">right</option>
        <option name="charting.drilldown">none</option>
      </chart>
    </panel>
  </row>
</dashboard>
